<section>
	<h2>Example</h2>
	<p>Loads data directly from a CSV file and populates a table using the
		<a href="https://www.datatables.net">DataTables</a>
		plugin into WET providing searching, sorting, filtering, pagination and
		other advanced features for tables.</p>


	<h3>Example 1</h3>
	<pre
	>&lt;table class="wb-tables table table-striped table-hover" data-wb-csv="ajax/eqarchive-en.csv"&gt;</pre>
	<p>This example uses data from Open Data, showing earthquake data from 2019.</p>
	<table
		class="wb-tables table table-striped table-hover"
		data-wb-tables='{ "ordering": false }'
		data-wb-csv="ajax/eqarchive-en.csv"
	></table>

	<h3>Example 2</h3>
	<p>Edge Cases</p>
	<table
		class="wb-tables table table-striped table-hover"
		data-wb-csv="ajax/test-csv-edge-cases.csv"
	></table>

	<h3>Example 3</h3>
	<p>Malformed</p>
	<table
		class="wb-tables table table-striped table-hover"
		data-wb-csv="ajax/test-csv-malformed.csv"
	></table>
</section>
